menu "Blink Example Configuration"

    config BLINK_GPIO
        int "Blink GPIO number"
        range 0 48
        default 2
        help
            GPIO number (IOxx) driving the LED to blink.
            Change this to match the LED wired on your ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 board.

    config BLINK_PERIOD_MS
        int "Blink period in ms"
        default 1000
        help
            Define the blinking period in milliseconds.

endmenu
